    {
     "id": "p001.s01",
     "source": "The Scottish Brownie formed a class of being distinct in habit and disposition from the freakish and mischievous elves."
    },
    {
     "id": "p001.s02",
     "source": "He was meagre, shaggy, and wild in his appearance."
    },
    {
     "id": "p001.s03",
     "source": "Thus Cleland, in his satire against the Highlanders, compares them to"
    }
